sonora (0.3.7) unstable; urgency=low

  * Export playlist: M3U/M3U8 (UTF-8), PLS and XSPF; whole playlist, only the
    entries shown (filter + sort order), only selected entries, or all
    playlists into a folder; absolute or relative paths; optional track
    information; cue sheets written as one .cue entry for other players.

