sonora (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Preferences: sound service / device selection, buffering, custom sink.
  * Spectrum: 0-24 kHz by default, 2x bars and FFT resolution, configurable.
  * LED style level meters with configurable range and width.
  * Playlist columns (title, artist, album, year, time, type), metadata
    tooltips, sorting, elapsed/remaining time, dark mode.
  * Space = play/pause, media keys and MPRIS2.

